---
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<div class="about-profile">
  <p class="about-lead">
    一个普通的<a href="https://www.scu.edu.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">四川大学</a>人工智能专业在读生（2025 级）。
  </p>
  <p>
    本人是ESFP，平时喜欢折腾AI、计算机网络、VPS等小东西，享受把「这玩意儿能跑吗」折腾成「居然真跑起来了」的过程。虽然会的不多，但是学的也很浅（雾
  </p>
  <p>
    这个博客是我的技术账本，网络实验、自托管服务和故障复盘都会整理成可以复现的记录。希望交到更多朋友~
  </p>

  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-elsewhere-title">
    <header class="about-section-heading">
      <p class="profile-kicker">ELSEWHERE</p>
      <h2 id="about-elsewhere-title">在别处</h2>
    </header>
    <ul class="about-social">
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/AndyYJF" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12" />
          </svg>
          <span class="s-label">GitHub</span>
          <span class="s-handle">@AndyYJF</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li data-geo-hide="CN">
        <a href="https://t.me/AndyYJF" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M22 2 11 13"></path>
            <path d="M22 2 15 22l-4-9-9-4 20-7z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="s-label">Telegram</span>
          <span class="s-handle">@AndyYJF</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="s-wide" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
            <path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <span class="s-label">Email</span>
          <span class="s-handle">{profile.email}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://peer.andy-y.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 5h14M5 5v14M19 5v14M5 19h14M5 19L19 5"></path>
            <circle cx="5" cy="5" r="2.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
            <circle cx="19" cy="5" r="2.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
            <circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
            <circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></circle>
          </svg>
          <span class="s-label">Peer With Me</span>
          <span class="s-handle">AS4242422921</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-timeline-title">
    <header class="about-section-heading">
      <p class="profile-kicker">TIMELINE</p>
      <h2 id="about-timeline-title">时间线</h2>
    </header>
    <ol class="about-timeline">
      <li>
        <time>2025-06-13</time>
        <span>建站，由 Typecho 驱动</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>2026-01-23</time>
        <span>发布第一篇文章（OMV 排障记录）</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>2026-02-19</time>
        <span>开始记录 DN42 实践</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <time>2026-08-17</time>
        <span>全站迁移到 Astro 静态化，Typecho 退居幕后做 CMS</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-setup-title">
    <header class="about-section-heading">
      <p class="profile-kicker">SETUP</p>
      <h2 id="about-setup-title">装备清单</h2>
    </header>
    <ul class="about-setup">
      <li>
        <span class="k">门户</span>
        <strong>Korami</strong>
        <small>
          <a href="https://korami.andy-y.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">korami.andy-y.cn</a>
           · 服务导航与状态页
        </small>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="k">实验网络</span>
        <strong>DN42 四节点</strong>
        <small>
          <a href="/dn42/">AS4242422921</a>
           · LAX / FRA / HKG / TYO full-mesh iBGP
        </small>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="k">服务器</span>
        <strong>VPS 集群</strong>
        <small>1Panel + OpenResty，服务全容器化</small>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="k">存储</span>
        <strong>OMV NAS</strong>
        <small>承担备份与媒体库</small>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-site-title">
    <header class="about-section-heading">
      <p class="profile-kicker">THIS SITE</p>
      <h2 id="about-site-title">这个站点</h2>
    </header>
    <p>
      页面由 Astro 静态生成，文章仍以 Typecho 为内容来源，并通过 Pagefind 提供按需加载的站内搜索。
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      本站使用 Umami 进行访问统计：它不写入 Cookie、不收集任何可识别个人身份的信息，所有数据均为匿名聚合，仅用于了解页面的访问情况。
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
